<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-20T03:38:28.526Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 03:38:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits in Plateau State have killed nine civilians in one attack and three miners at a mining site, while also kidnapping six people and stealing livestock in Sokoto. Armed groups in northern forests have been filmed wearing army uniforms and caps, and security forces rescued 125 kidnapping victims and killed 21 ISWAP fighters in Borno. Troops in Zamfara foiled a terrorist attack on Kwanan Ayo and rescued two civilians, and a suspected robber killed a person known as Benue Chris Brown in Makurdi. Police are searching for the family of a Canadian-Nigerian man killed in a road crash near Lagos Airport. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxNRVg0aXlnWTRHdk81aU1LbThMMktiemtaa0hfRnk4bFdlZWs5aUVYVjlhMGVXVjZQOXNraWNRTGFGMTNFTlJ3aVFwWGUzREphRDRnNlljVE5xZmFkSlVrMDVSOTZ0V2R1VzNfSTNtcU91eEhNeU5teDVuM2JBLVFCaHppNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPTHB6dnV2Q1NrZE5lVEgtMVhWS2RkekZzNExVLWFHYVBMWEpxYnkxWXIxcTR2YV9LRkQ2Z295SGRaNldQblhVZGF5ekxNSTlweFo3WEtyT2VOZm5VUVBTY1B2bEtDVkRfQnVZVmFud3ZMZUFmbVN2elMxUGJBaVlXNjluMUg?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTFBubmxVSW1FOGdEVXBsQkZycC1nZjZLZUtWODE3SFgwV1F0Y25sdlVSLVJSU3NKbjBFc25FSEFWdzRrWnlUQlcydjF5N0ZRVnJkR0tKUEtrTDVYeEtNOHFtYVNuOXpLc1pOdFQwenl1aGgwa1dMc3dsRGoxS2ZOOU0?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Whistler Newspaper&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTE9OX3lRcHhwTWRYZmsyeVBxazJUMl9QLUpjcmd5bnU3ZmEtMXI1M3M5WDN6dkxDZVRNLTUtbDVqLUgybUdBb0NYSTVwd2REb2VRNnFn?oc=5&quot;&gt;شبكة تواصل الإخبارية&lt;/a&gt;, 